   "text": "Aba, the Restless, asked the fair question first. What exactly did he take over? On the 15th of May, 1979, a young flight lieutenant and a handful of soldiers tried to overthrow General H. Kufo's government and failed. He was tried, sentenced to death, and locked up. On the 4th of June, soldiers broke him out, and within hours he was chairman of the Armed Forces Revolutionary Council, which ruled for 112 days, executed eight senior officers, among them,",
